466
00:23:18,250 --> 00:23:19,666
Baik. Kau juga?

467
00:23:21,125 --> 00:23:22,833
- Dia ada di rumah?
- Ya.

468
00:23:28,875 --> 00:23:30,208
Semua baik-baik saja?

469
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:33,791
Kenapa menyuruhku kemari?

470
00:23:35,791 --> 00:23:37,208
Di mana Noa?

471
00:23:38,416 --> 00:23:40,125
- Noa!
- Dia sakit.

472
