Kita akan mencukur Coralie?

531
00:29:19,791 --> 00:29:21,083
Ya!

532
00:29:21,166 --> 00:29:23,750
Kita merayakan operasi Coralie besok!

533
00:29:23,833 --> 00:29:29,583
