536
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,250
"Laisse-moi" oleh KeBlack.

537
00:29:38,333 --> 00:29:42,583
Beri tepuk tangan! Seleranya bagus!

538
00:29:43,666 --> 00:29:44,833
Putrimu cantik.

539
00:29:44,916 --> 00:29:45,750
Terima kasih.

540
00:29:45,833 --> 00:29:46,666
Ya!

541
