<i>Jangan ganggu aku</i>
<i>Kumohon, jangan ganggu aku</i>

569
00:31:02,083 --> 00:31:06,250
<i>Sudah kubilang tak mungkin</i>
<i>Kumohon, jangan ganggu aku</i>

570
00:31:06,333 --> 00:31:08,166
<i>Kulihat hatiku</i>
<i>Untuk lihat masa depanku</i>

571
00:31:08,250 --> 00:31:09,541
<i>Aku tak ingin bersama dia</i>

572
00:31:10,125 --> 00:31:12,000
<i>Suasananya tak ceria</i>
<i>Aku tak selaras</i>

573
00:31:12,083 --> 00:31:14,250
<i>- Kau paham artinya</i>
<i>- Kau mengerti</i>

574
00:31:14,333 --> 00:31:16,416
<i>- Apa yang kau inginkan?</i>
<i>- Katakan</i>

575
00:31:16,500 --> 00:31:18,250
<i>- Cinta kita sudah sirna</i>
<i>- Kenapa?</i>

576
00:31:18,333 --> 00:31:21,916
<i>Dia membuatku gila</i>
<i>Hubungan kami sudah berlalu</i>

577
