690
00:38:08,666 --> 00:38:10,208
Bukan kau atau siapa pun.

691
00:38:10,791 --> 00:38:11,875
Mengerti?

692
00:38:12,458 --> 00:38:13,708
Mari berjuang bersama.

693
00:38:14,291 --> 00:38:16,291
