992
00:58:33,916 --> 00:58:35,708
Vincent, tangani keamanan.

993
00:58:36,208 --> 00:58:37,875
<i>Area sekitar sudah diamankan…</i>

994
00:58:37,958 --> 00:58:40,958
Halo, Nyonya.
Manenti, SWAT. Dan, asistenku.

995
