1062
01:02:41,583 --> 01:02:43,416
<i>Fabienne Durand dari CECOS.</i>

1063
01:02:43,500 --> 01:02:46,458
<i>Aku baru menerima pesanmu,</i>
<i>tetapi ini menggelikan.</i>

1064
01:02:46,541 --> 01:02:47,708
