1065
01:02:47,791 --> 01:02:48,666
Campos?

1066
01:02:49,500 --> 01:02:51,125
- Fabienne Durand.
- Butuh mereka.

1067
01:02:51,208 --> 01:02:52,833
<i>- Baik.</i>
- Kupakai pelantang.

1068
01:02:52,916 --> 01:02:55,083
<i>Entah bagaimana aku bisa membantu,</i>

1069
01:02:55,166 --> 01:02:58,291
